import json,re,sys
from pathlib import Path
root=Path(sys.argv[1]);data={}
CASES={
 'holy':('The staff that only pointed at one',
  'A level fifty priest wears a ring carrying the staff-holiness activation and faces three white harpies to its east. The activation floods the area with goodness - every evil monster in sight - but the maneuver kept the bolt radius of zero and valued a single harpy on a line: twenty-eight. The correction uses the LOS-dispel radius of ten, which the corrected launch values as the sight-line sum: sixty.'),
 'control':('Control: the lesser acid bolt ring',
  'The same priest also wears a ring carrying the lesser acid bolt, a genuine single-target activation. It is valued identically at twenty-eight before and after the correction, and the complete log is byte-identical: the fix changes only the staff-holiness radius.')}
for mode,(label,explanation) in CASES.items():
 item={'label':label,'explanation':explanation}
 for phase in ('before','after'):
  raw=(root/f'{phase}-{mode}.log').read_text()
  entry={'raw':raw,'passed':'native-c/staff-262 finished: 1/1 passed' in raw}
  for tag in ('GEOMETRY ','RATING ','OUTCOME '):
   match=re.search(re.escape(tag)+r'(.*)',raw)
   entry[tag.split()[0].lower()]=match[1].strip() if match else None
  item[phase]=entry
 data[mode]=item
html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>The staff that only pointed at one</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f4f1ea;color:#253a3c;font:18px/1.6 system-ui}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 24px}h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.2}h2{font-size:24px}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd6d0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin:18px 0}.cards .card{border-top:6px solid #648e80}.num{font-size:34px;font-weight:750}select,button{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #aabdb5;border-radius:7px;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;margin:14px 8px 0 0}button.active{background:#24685d;color:white}.summary{background:#e6eee6;padding:20px;border-left:5px solid #377367}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.5 monospace;max-height:330px;overflow:auto}details{background:white;padding:20px;margin:20px 0}summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:650px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:30px}}</style><main><p>Recorded native staff-holiness valuations</p><h1>The staff that only pointed at one</h1><p>The staff-holiness activation floods the area with goodness, striking every evil monster in sight. The Borg valued it as a single-target bolt - radius zero, one monster on a line - because the maneuver never set the LOS-dispel radius its effect and damage already describe. With the LOS-dispel launch corrected, the radius change turns the valuation into the sight-line sum it should be.</p><section class="card"><label for="scenario">Choose a recorded situation</label><br><select id="scenario"></select><p id="explanation"></p><br><button data-step="0">Maneuver value</button></section><div class="cards"><section id="original" class="card"><h2>Bolt radius</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section><section id="compared" class="card"><h2>LOS radius</h2><div class="num"></div><p class="state"></p></section></div><p class="summary" id="outcome"></p><h2>What the control establishes</h2><p>The lesser acid bolt ring, a genuine single-target activation, is valued identically before and after with byte-identical logs: the fix changes only the staff-holiness radius. This correction is stacked on the LOS-dispel walk fix it depends on.</p><details><summary>Experiment conditions and limits</summary><p>Native Human Priest level fifty, depth thirty, seed one thousand, lit constructed arena, a worn ring whose activation is the table STAFF_HOLY entry (and one carrying ACID_BOLT2 as the control), charged, three awake white harpies east of the priest. Stacked on the LOS-dispel walk correction; the bolt-radius reading is measured at that correction alone. The measurement calls the public maneuver chooser with borg_simulate set. This isolates the radius token, not full autonomous play. No death or survival claim.</p></details><details><summary>Recorded native output</summary><h3>Bolt radius</h3><pre id="original-log"></pre><h3>LOS radius</h3><pre id="compared-log"></pre></details><p>Canonical report: <a href="https://github.com/diegoami/neo-angband-tracker/issues/262">issue262</a>.</p></main><script>
const data=__DATA__;const select=document.getElementById('scenario');for(const [key,c] of Object.entries(data)){let o=document.createElement('option');o.value=key;o.textContent=c.label;select.append(o)}function draw(){let c=data[select.value];document.getElementById('explanation').textContent=c.explanation;for(const [panel,phase] of [['original','before'],['compared','after']]){let d=c[phase],p=document.getElementById(panel);let r=d.rating||'';let m=r.match(/holy=(-?\\d+)/)||r.match(/bolt2=(-?\\d+)/);p.querySelector('.num').textContent='Maneuver value: '+(m?m[1]:'n/a');p.querySelector('.state').textContent=d.outcome||'';document.getElementById(panel+'-log').textContent=d.raw}document.getElementById('outcome').textContent=select.value==='holy'?'The bolt radius values one harpy at 28; the LOS radius values the sight lines at 60.':'A genuine single-target activation: 28 either way, byte for byte.';}select.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();</script></html>'''
(root/'replay.html').write_text(html.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(data).replace('<','\\u003c')))
(root/'replay-data.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2)+'\n')
print('Open in your browser:',root/'replay.html')
